{"id":"ef-a0","level":"A0","units":{"1A":{"title":"Nice to meet you","words":[["hello","a word you say when you meet someone","привет, здравствуйте","слово, которое говорят при встрече","Hello, I am Anna.","Hello, I am + name","Hello, I am Tom."],["goodbye","a word you say when you leave","до свидания","слово, которое говорят при прощании","Goodbye, see you on Monday.","Goodbye, + name","Goodbye, Anna."],["name","what people call you","имя","то, как вас зовут","My name is Dana.","My name is + name","My name is Timur."],["one","the number 1","один","число 1","I have one book.","one + noun","I have one pen."],["two","the number 2","два","число 2","I have two bags.","two + noun","I have two books."],["five","the number 5","пять","число 5","I am in room five.","room + number","You are in room two."],["ten","the number 10","десять","число 10","I have ten pens.","ten + noun","I have ten books."],["Monday","the first day of the working week","понедельник","первый день рабочей недели","Today is Monday.","Today is + day","Today is Friday."],["Friday","the day before Saturday","пятница","день перед субботой","See you on Friday.","on + day","See you on Monday."],["Sunday","the day after Saturday","воскресенье","день после субботы","I am at home on Sunday.","on Sunday","You are at home on Sunday."],["teacher","a person who teaches","учитель","человек, который учит","I am a teacher.","I am a + job","I am a student."],["student","a person who learns","студент, ученик","человек, который учится","You are a student.","You are a + noun","You are a teacher."]],"g":{"title":"Verb be: I and you","rule":"<p>Use <b>am</b> with I. Use <b>are</b> with you.</p><table><tr><td>I</td><td>I <b>am</b> Anna. · I<b>'m</b> a student.</td></tr><tr><td>you</td><td>You <b>are</b> Tom. · You<b>'re</b> a teacher.</td></tr><tr><td>question</td><td><b>Are you</b> Tom? Yes, I <b>am</b>.</td></tr></table>","ru":"Глагол be: I am (I'm) — «я есть», you are (you're) — «ты / вы есть». В вопросе are стоит первым: Are you Tom?","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"I ___ Dana.","o":["am","are","is"],"a":0},{"t":"mc","q":"You ___ a student.","o":["am","are","is"],"a":1},{"t":"gap","q":"___ you a teacher? Yes, I am.","a":["Are"]}]},"talk":["Say hello. Say your name: Hello, I am…","Ask your partner: Are you a student?"],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Verb be: I and you"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: Nice to meet you"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"1B":{"title":"Music round the world","words":[["country","a place like Kazakhstan or Japan","страна","место, например Казахстан или Япония","Brazil is a big country.","a + adjective + country","It is a small country."],["Kazakhstan","a big country in Asia","Казахстан","большая страна в Азии","She is from Kazakhstan.","from + country","He is from Kazakhstan."],["England","a country; London is there","Англия","страна, где находится Лондон","He is from England.","from England","She is from England."],["Spain","a country in Europe; Madrid is there","Испания","страна в Европе, где находится Мадрид","Madrid is in Spain.","in + country","It is in Spain."],["Turkey","a country; Istanbul is there","Турция","страна, где находится Стамбул","She is from Turkey.","from Turkey","He is from Turkey."],["China","a very big country in Asia","Китай","очень большая страна в Азии","He is from China.","from China","It is from China."],["Japan","a country in Asia; Tokyo is there","Япония","страна в Азии, где находится Токио","Tokyo is in Japan.","in Japan","She is in Japan."],["Brazil","a big country in South America","Бразилия","большая страна в Южной Америке","The music is from Brazil.","from Brazil","He is from Brazil."],["music","songs and sounds you listen to","музыка","песни и звуки, которые мы слушаем","The music is from Spain.","The music is + adjective","The music is good."],["singer","a person who sings","певец, певица","человек, который поёт","She is a singer.","He / She is a + job","He is a singer."],["city","a big town","город","большой населённый пункт","It is a big city.","a + adjective + city","It is a nice city."],["where","a word to ask about a place","где, откуда","слово для вопроса о месте","Where is she from?","Where is + he / she + from?","Where is he from?"]],"g":{"title":"Verb be: he, she, it","rule":"<p>Use <b>is</b> with he, she and it.</p><table><tr><td>he</td><td>He <b>is</b> from Spain. · He<b>'s</b> a singer.</td></tr><tr><td>she</td><td>She <b>is</b> from China. · She<b>'s</b> a teacher.</td></tr><tr><td>it</td><td>It <b>is</b> from Brazil. · It<b>'s</b> a big country.</td></tr><tr><td>question</td><td><b>Is he</b> from Japan? No, he <b>isn't</b>.</td></tr></table>","ru":"С he, she, it используем is (he's, she's, it's). Отрицание: isn't. Вопрос: Is he…? Is she…?","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"She ___ from Turkey.","o":["am","are","is"],"a":2},{"t":"mc","q":"___ he a singer?","o":["Is","Are","Am"],"a":0},{"t":"gap","q":"It ___ a big city.","a":["is","'s"]}]},"talk":["Talk about a singer: He is from… She is from…","Ask: Where is he from? Where is she from?"],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Verb be: he, she, it"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: Music round the world"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"2A":{"title":"Are you on holiday?","words":[["English","from England","английский, англичанин","из Англии","We are English.","We are + nationality","They are English."],["Spanish","from Spain","испанский, испанец","из Испании","They are Spanish.","They are + nationality","We are Spanish."],["Turkish","from Turkey","турецкий, турок","из Турции","We are Turkish.","be + nationality","You are Turkish."],["Chinese","from China","китайский, китаец","из Китая","They are Chinese.","be + nationality","We are Chinese."],["Japanese","from Japan","японский, японец","из Японии","We are Japanese.","be + nationality","They are Japanese."],["Kazakh","from Kazakhstan","казахский, казах","из Казахстана","We are Kazakh.","be + nationality","They are Kazakh."],["holiday","days when you do not work","отпуск, каникулы","дни, когда вы не работаете","We are on holiday.","on holiday","They are on holiday."],["hotel","a place where you sleep on holiday","гостиница","место, где живут в поездке","We are in a hotel.","in a hotel","They are in a hotel."],["friends","people you like and know well","друзья","люди, которых вы любите и хорошо знаете","They are my friends.","my friends","We are friends."],["tourist","a person on holiday in a new place","турист","человек на отдыхе в новом месте","We are tourists.","be a tourist","They are tourists."],["airport","a place where planes are","аэропорт","место, где находятся самолёты","We are at the airport.","at the airport","They are at the airport."],["here","in this place","здесь","в этом месте","We are here on holiday.","be here","They are here."]],"g":{"title":"Verb be: we, you, they","rule":"<p>Use <b>are</b> with we, you and they.</p><table><tr><td>we</td><td>We <b>are</b> on holiday. · We<b>'re</b> Kazakh.</td></tr><tr><td>they</td><td>They <b>are</b> tourists. · They<b>'re</b> Spanish.</td></tr><tr><td>negative</td><td>We <b>aren't</b> English.</td></tr><tr><td>question</td><td><b>Are they</b> on holiday? Yes, they <b>are</b>.</td></tr></table>","ru":"С we, you, they используем are (we're, they're). Отрицание: aren't. Вопрос: Are they…?","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"We ___ from Kazakhstan.","o":["is","am","are"],"a":2},{"t":"mc","q":"They ___ English. They are Spanish.","o":["aren't","isn't","am not"],"a":0},{"t":"gap","q":"___ they tourists? Yes, they are.","a":["Are"]}]},"talk":["Talk about you and your friends: We are… We aren't…","Ask: Are you on holiday? Are they tourists?"],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Verb be: we, you, they"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: Are you on holiday?"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"2B":{"title":"What number is the bus?","words":[["eleven","the number 11","одиннадцать","число 11","The bus is number eleven.","number + number","It is number eleven."],["twelve","the number 12","двенадцать","число 12","I am in room twelve.","room twelve","We are in room twelve."],["twenty","the number 20","двадцать","число 20","I am twenty.","I am + age","She is twenty."],["thirty","the number 30","тридцать","число 30","He is thirty.","be + age","I am thirty."],["fifty","the number 50","пятьдесят","число 50","The ticket is fifty dollars.","number + dollars","It is fifty dollars."],["a hundred","the number 100","сто","число 100","The hotel is a hundred dollars.","a hundred + noun","It is a hundred metres."],["phone number","the number of your phone","номер телефона","номер вашего телефона","What is your phone number?","What is your + noun?","What is your name?"],["address","where your house is","адрес","где находится ваш дом","What is your address?","your address","My address is 5 Park Street."],["bus","a big car for many people","автобус","большая машина для многих людей","What number is the bus?","the + number + bus","It is the number ten bus."],["how old","a question about age","сколько лет","вопрос о возрасте","How old are you?","How old + is / are + subject?","How old is he?"],["what","a word to ask about a thing","что, какой","слово для вопроса о предмете","What is your name?","What is + noun?","What is your address?"],["how","a word to ask about the way","как","слово для вопроса о способе","How are you?","How + is / are + subject?","How is your mother?"]],"g":{"title":"Wh- and How questions","rule":"<p>Start a question with a <b>question word</b>. Then use <b>is</b> or <b>are</b>.</p><table><tr><td>What</td><td><b>What is</b> your name?</td></tr><tr><td>Where</td><td><b>Where are</b> you from?</td></tr><tr><td>How old</td><td><b>How old is</b> he?</td></tr><tr><td>How</td><td><b>How are</b> you?</td></tr></table>","ru":"Вопрос начинается с вопросительного слова: What (что, какой), Where (где, откуда), How old (сколько лет), How (как). Затем is или are.","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"___ is your phone number?","o":["What","Where","How old"],"a":0},{"t":"mc","q":"___ are you from?","o":["What","Where","How"],"a":1},{"t":"gap","q":"How old ___ you?","a":["are"]}]},"talk":["Ask your partner: What is your name? Where are you from? How old are you?","Ask for a phone number and an address."],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Wh- and How questions"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: What number is the bus?"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"3A":{"title":"Where's my phone?","words":[["phone","a thing you use to call people","телефон","вещь, по которой звонят","Where is my phone?","Where is my + noun?","Where is my bag?"],["key","a small thing that opens a door","ключ","маленькая вещь, которая открывает дверь","It is a key.","It is a + noun","It is a pen."],["bag","a thing for your books and things","сумка","вещь для книг и других предметов","It is a bag.","a bag","It is a big bag."],["pen","a thing you write with","ручка","вещь, которой пишут","It is a pen.","a pen","I have a pen."],["book","a thing you read","книга","вещь, которую читают","They are books.","They are + plural noun","They are pens."],["umbrella","a thing you use in the rain","зонт","вещь, которой пользуются в дождь","It is an umbrella.","an + a, e, i, o, u","It is an apple."],["watch","a small clock on your arm","наручные часы","маленькие часы на руке","It is a watch.","a watch","They are watches."],["glasses","a thing you wear to see well","очки","вещь, которую носят, чтобы лучше видеть","They are my glasses.","They are my + plural noun","They are my keys."],["wallet","a small thing for your money","кошелёк","маленькая вещь для денег","It is a wallet.","a wallet","Where is my wallet?"],["laptop","a small computer","ноутбук","небольшой компьютер","It is a laptop.","a laptop","They are laptops."],["table","a thing you eat or work at","стол","предмет, за которым едят или работают","The keys are on the table.","on the table","The pen is on the table."],["chair","a thing you sit on","стул","предмет, на котором сидят","The bag is on the chair.","on the chair","The book is on the chair."]],"g":{"title":"Singular and plural nouns, a / an","rule":"<p>For one thing use <b>a</b> or <b>an</b>. For two or more, add <b>-s</b>.</p><table><tr><td>a + b, c, d, f…</td><td><b>a</b> pen · <b>a</b> bag</td></tr><tr><td>an + a, e, i, o, u</td><td><b>an</b> umbrella · <b>an</b> apple</td></tr><tr><td>plural: + -s</td><td>two pen<b>s</b> · three key<b>s</b></td></tr><tr><td>plural: + -es</td><td>two watch<b>es</b> · three box<b>es</b></td></tr></table>","ru":"Один предмет: a (перед согласным) или an (перед гласным). Много предметов: + -s (pens) или -es (watches).","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"It is ___ umbrella.","o":["a","an","—"],"a":1},{"t":"mc","q":"They are ___.","o":["key","keys","a keys"],"a":1},{"t":"gap","q":"I have two ___ (watch).","a":["watches"]}]},"talk":["What is in your bag? It is a… They are…","Point at things in the room and say the words."],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Singular and plural nouns, a / an"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: Where's my phone?"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"3B":{"title":"Souvenirs","words":[["this","the thing here, near me","этот, эта, это","предмет здесь, рядом со мной","This is a cup.","This is a + noun","This is a hat."],["that","the thing there, not near me","тот, та, то","предмет там, не рядом со мной","That is a T-shirt.","That is a + noun","That is a map."],["these","the things here, near me","эти","предметы здесь, рядом со мной","These are postcards.","These are + plural noun","These are keys."],["those","the things there, not near me","те","предметы там, не рядом со мной","Those are hats.","Those are + plural noun","Those are cups."],["souvenir","a thing you buy on holiday","сувенир","вещь, которую покупают в поездке","This is a souvenir.","a souvenir","That is a souvenir."],["postcard","a card with a photo of a place","открытка","карточка с фотографией места","These are postcards.","a postcard","This is a postcard."],["T-shirt","a shirt with short arms","футболка","рубашка с короткими рукавами","That is a T-shirt.","a T-shirt","This is a T-shirt."],["cup","a thing you drink tea from","чашка","предмет, из которого пьют чай","This is a cup.","a cup","Those are cups."],["hat","a thing you wear on your head","шапка, шляпа","вещь, которую носят на голове","That is a hat.","a hat","These are hats."],["map","a picture of a city or country","карта","изображение города или страны","This is a map.","a map","That is a map."],["toy","a thing a child plays with","игрушка","вещь, с которой играет ребёнок","These are toys.","a toy","This is a toy."],["how much","a question about the price","сколько стоит","вопрос о цене","How much is this cup?","How much is + this / that + noun?","How much is that hat?"]],"g":{"title":"this / that / these / those","rule":"<p>Use <b>this</b> and <b>these</b> for things near you. Use <b>that</b> and <b>those</b> for things not near you.</p><table><tr><td>near, one thing</td><td><b>This</b> is a cup.</td></tr><tr><td>near, two or more</td><td><b>These</b> are postcards.</td></tr><tr><td>not near, one thing</td><td><b>That</b> is a hat.</td></tr><tr><td>not near, two or more</td><td><b>Those</b> are T-shirts.</td></tr></table>","ru":"This (этот) и these (эти) — предметы рядом. That (тот) и those (те) — предметы далеко. This / that — один предмет, these / those — много.","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"___ are my keys. (near)","o":["This","These","That"],"a":1},{"t":"mc","q":"___ is a map. (not near)","o":["That","Those","These"],"a":0},{"t":"gap","q":"How much is ___ cup? (near)","a":["this"]}]},"talk":["You are in a souvenir shop. Ask: How much is this…? How much are those…?","Show three things: This is… These are…"],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"this / that / these / those"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: Souvenirs"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"4A":{"title":"This is my family","words":[["mother","your mum","мать, мама","ваша мама","This is my mother.","This is my + noun","This is my father."],["father","your dad","отец, папа","ваш папа","His father is a doctor.","his + noun","His mother is a teacher."],["brother","a boy with the same parents as you","брат","мальчик, у которого те же родители","Her brother is ten.","her + noun","Her sister is twenty."],["sister","a girl with the same parents as you","сестра","девочка, у которой те же родители","This is my sister.","my sister","Her name is Dana."],["son","your boy child","сын","ваш ребёнок-мальчик","Their son is a student.","their + noun","Their daughter is five."],["daughter","your girl child","дочь","ваш ребёнок-девочка","Our daughter is three.","our + noun","Our son is ten."],["husband","the man a woman is married to","муж","мужчина, за которым замужем женщина","This is Anna's husband.","name + 's + noun","This is Tom's wife."],["wife","the woman a man is married to","жена","женщина, на которой женат мужчина","This is Tom's wife.","name + 's + noun","This is Anna's son."],["family","your mother, father, brothers and sisters","семья","мать, отец, братья и сёстры","This is my family.","my family","This is our family."],["boy","a young man or male child","мальчик","ребёнок мужского пола","The boy is my brother.","the boy","The boy is ten."],["girl","a young woman or female child","девочка","ребёнок женского пола","The girl is my sister.","the girl","The girl is five."],["children","boys and girls","дети","мальчики и девочки","They are my children.","my children","These are our children."]],"g":{"title":"Possessive adjectives, possessive 's","rule":"<p>Say <b>whose</b> a thing or a person is.</p><table><tr><td>I → my · you → your</td><td><b>My</b> mother · <b>your</b> father</td></tr><tr><td>he → his · she → her</td><td><b>his</b> sister · <b>her</b> brother</td></tr><tr><td>we → our · they → their</td><td><b>our</b> son · <b>their</b> daughter</td></tr><tr><td>name + 's</td><td><b>Anna's</b> husband · <b>Tom's</b> wife</td></tr></table>","ru":"Притяжательные слова: my (мой), your (твой), his (его), her (её), our (наш), their (их). Имя + 's: Anna's husband — муж Анны.","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"This is Tom and this is ___ wife.","o":["her","his","he"],"a":1},{"t":"mc","q":"We have a son. ___ son is ten.","o":["Our","We","Their"],"a":0},{"t":"gap","q":"This is ___ (Anna) brother.","a":["Anna's"]}]},"talk":["Show a photo: This is my… His name is… Her name is…","Talk about a friend's family: This is Dana's…"],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Possessive adjectives, possessive 's"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: This is my family"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"4B":{"title":"The right car for me","words":[["big","not small","большой","не маленький","It is a big car.","a big + noun","It is a big house."],["small","not big","маленький","не большой","It is a small bag.","a small + noun","It is a small car."],["new","not old","новый","не старый","It is a new phone.","a new + noun","It is a new car."],["old","not new, not young","старый","не новый, не молодой","It is an old car.","an old + noun","It is an old house."],["fast","not slow","быстрый","не медленный","It is a fast car.","a fast + noun","It is a fast bus."],["slow","not fast","медленный","не быстрый","It is a slow bus.","a slow + noun","It is a slow car."],["good","nice; not bad","хороший","приятный; не плохой","It is a good car.","a good + noun","It is a good book."],["cheap","not expensive","дешёвый","не дорогой","It is a cheap hotel.","a cheap + noun","It is a cheap phone."],["expensive","not cheap","дорогой","не дешёвый","It is an expensive car.","an expensive + noun","It is an expensive watch."],["red","the colour of a tomato","красный","цвет помидора","It is a red car.","a red + noun","It is a red bag."],["blue","the colour of the sky","синий, голубой","цвет неба","It is a blue car.","a blue + noun","It is a blue pen."],["black","the colour of the night","чёрный","цвет ночи","It is a black car.","a black + noun","It is a black hat."]],"g":{"title":"Adjectives","rule":"<p>An adjective tells you about a thing. It goes <b>before</b> the noun, or after <b>be</b>.</p><table><tr><td>before a noun</td><td>a <b>red</b> car · a <b>big</b> house</td></tr><tr><td>after be</td><td>The car is <b>new</b>.</td></tr><tr><td>no -s</td><td>two <b>red</b> cars (not <s>reds</s>)</td></tr></table>","ru":"Прилагательное стоит перед существительным (a red car) или после be (The car is new). Оно не изменяется: two red cars.","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"It is a ___.","o":["car fast","fast car","fasts car"],"a":1},{"t":"mc","q":"The cars are ___.","o":["news","new","a new"],"a":1},{"t":"gap","q":"It is an ___ (expensive) watch.","a":["expensive"]}]},"talk":["Talk about a car: It is… It is a… car.","Talk about three things you have: My phone is…"],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Adjectives"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: The right car for me"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"5A":{"title":"My favourite meal","words":[["bread","a food made from flour","хлеб","еда из муки","I eat bread.","I eat + food","I eat rice."],["cheese","a food made from milk","сыр","еда из молока","I like cheese.","I like + food","I like bread."],["meat","food from animals","мясо","еда из животных","I don't eat meat.","I don't eat + food","I don't eat fish."],["fish","an animal from the sea that we eat","рыба","морское животное, которое мы едим","We eat fish.","We eat + food","We eat meat."],["rice","small white food from Asia","рис","мелкая белая еда из Азии","I eat rice.","eat rice","They eat rice."],["eggs","food from chickens","яйца","еда от кур","I have eggs.","have + food","We have eggs."],["fruit","apples, bananas and oranges","фрукты","яблоки, бананы и апельсины","I like fruit.","like fruit","We like fruit."],["vegetables","carrots, tomatoes and potatoes","овощи","морковь, помидоры и картофель","I eat vegetables.","eat vegetables","We eat vegetables."],["tea","a hot drink","чай","горячий напиток","I drink tea.","I drink + noun","I drink water."],["coffee","a hot black or brown drink","кофе","горячий чёрный или коричневый напиток","I don't drink coffee.","I don't drink + noun","I don't drink tea."],["water","a drink with no colour","вода","напиток без цвета","We drink water.","drink water","They drink water."],["breakfast","the food you eat in the morning","завтрак","еда, которую едят утром","I have breakfast.","have breakfast","We have breakfast."]],"g":{"title":"Present simple (+ and –): I, you, we, they","rule":"<p>Use the present simple for things you do <b>every day</b>.</p><table><tr><td>positive</td><td>I <b>eat</b> bread. · We <b>drink</b> tea.</td></tr><tr><td>negative: don't + verb</td><td>I <b>don't eat</b> meat. · They <b>don't drink</b> coffee.</td></tr></table>","ru":"Present simple — то, что вы делаете обычно. С I, you, we, they глагол без изменений: I eat. Отрицание: don't + глагол.","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"I ___ tea in the morning.","o":["drink","drinks","am drink"],"a":0},{"t":"mc","q":"We ___ meat.","o":["not eat","don't eat","aren't eat"],"a":1},{"t":"gap","q":"They ___ (not / like) fish.","a":["don't like","do not like"]}]},"talk":["Talk about your food: I eat… I don't eat… I drink…","Talk about breakfast in your family: We have…"],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Present simple (+ and –): I, you, we, they"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: My favourite meal"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"5B":{"title":"A very long flight","words":[["read","look at words in a book","читать","смотреть на слова в книге","Do you read books?","Do you + verb?","Do you read?"],["watch","look at a film or TV","смотреть","смотреть фильм или телевизор","Do you watch films?","watch + noun","I watch films."],["listen","hear music or people","слушать","слышать музыку или людей","Do you listen to music?","listen to + noun","I listen to music."],["sleep","close your eyes and rest at night","спать","закрыть глаза и отдыхать ночью","Do you sleep on a plane?","sleep + place","I sleep at home."],["work","do your job","работать","делать свою работу","Do you work?","work + place","I work in a bank."],["live","have your home in a place","жить","иметь дом в каком-то месте","Do you live in Almaty?","live in + place","I live in Astana."],["speak","say words","говорить","произносить слова","Do you speak English?","speak + language","I speak Russian."],["want","wish to have","хотеть","желать иметь","Do you want tea?","want + noun","I want coffee."],["have","own","иметь","владеть","Do you have a book?","have + noun","I have a phone."],["play","do a game or sport","играть","заниматься игрой или спортом","Do you play games?","play + noun","I play games."],["flight","a trip on a plane","рейс, полёт","поездка на самолёте","It is a long flight.","a long flight","It is a short flight."],["plane","a thing that flies in the sky","самолёт","то, что летает в небе","Do you like planes?","on a plane","I sleep on a plane."]],"g":{"title":"Present simple (?): I, you, we, they","rule":"<p>Make a question with <b>Do</b>.</p><table><tr><td>question</td><td><b>Do you</b> read books?</td></tr><tr><td>short answers</td><td>Yes, I <b>do</b>. · No, I <b>don't</b>.</td></tr><tr><td>with a question word</td><td><b>What do you</b> read? · <b>Where do they</b> live?</td></tr></table>","ru":"Вопрос в present simple: Do + you / we / they + глагол? Краткий ответ: Yes, I do. / No, I don't.","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"___ you speak English?","o":["Are","Do","Is"],"a":1},{"t":"mc","q":"Do you watch films? Yes, I ___.","o":["watch","am","do"],"a":2},{"t":"gap","q":"Where ___ you live?","a":["do"]}]},"talk":["Ask your partner five questions: Do you…?","Ask: What do you do on a plane?"],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Present simple (?): I, you, we, they"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: A very long flight"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"6A":{"title":"Old friends?","words":[["doctor","a person who helps ill people","врач","человек, который помогает больным","She is a doctor.","She works in a + place","She works in a hospital."],["nurse","a person who helps a doctor","медсестра, медбрат","человек, который помогает врачу","He is a nurse.","He works in a + place","He works in a hospital."],["waiter","a person who brings food in a café","официант","человек, который приносит еду в кафе","He works in a café.","work in a café","She works in a café."],["driver","a person who drives a car or bus","водитель","человек, который водит машину или автобус","He drives a bus.","drive + noun","She drives a taxi."],["shop assistant","a person who works in a shop","продавец","человек, который работает в магазине","She works in a shop.","work in a shop","He works in a shop."],["office","a place where people work at desks","офис","место, где люди работают за столами","He works in an office.","in an office","She works in an office."],["hospital","a place for ill people","больница","место для больных","She works in a hospital.","in a hospital","He works in a hospital."],["school","a place where children learn","школа","место, где учатся дети","He teaches in a school.","in a school","She works in a school."],["factory","a place where people make things","завод, фабрика","место, где делают вещи","He works in a factory.","in a factory","She works in a factory."],["restaurant","a place where you eat","ресторан","место, где едят","She cooks in a restaurant.","in a restaurant","He works in a restaurant."],["job","the work you do","работа","то, чем вы занимаетесь","He likes his job.","like + your job","She likes her job."],["friend","a person you like and know well","друг","человек, которого вы любите и хорошо знаете","She has an old friend.","an old friend","He has a new friend."]],"g":{"title":"Present simple: he, she, it","rule":"<p>With he, she and it, add <b>-s</b> to the verb.</p><table><tr><td>positive</td><td>He <b>works</b> in a bank. · She <b>likes</b> her job.</td></tr><tr><td>negative: doesn't + verb</td><td>She <b>doesn't work</b> in an office.</td></tr><tr><td>question: Does + verb</td><td><b>Does he work</b> here? Yes, he <b>does</b>.</td></tr><tr><td>spelling</td><td>go → go<b>es</b> · have → <b>has</b> · teach → teach<b>es</b></td></tr></table>","ru":"С he, she, it к глаголу добавляем -s: he works. Отрицание: doesn't + глагол. Вопрос: Does he…? Исключения: goes, has.","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"She ___ in a hospital.","o":["work","works","working"],"a":1},{"t":"mc","q":"He ___ in a shop.","o":["don't work","doesn't work","isn't work"],"a":1},{"t":"gap","q":"___ she like her job?","a":["Does"]}]},"talk":["Talk about a friend: He works in… She doesn't…","Ask about a friend's job: Does he…? Where does she…?"],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Present simple: he, she, it"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: Old friends?"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]},"6B":{"title":"Good morning, goodnight","words":[["get up","leave your bed in the morning","вставать","покидать кровать утром","I always get up at seven.","always + verb","I always get up early."],["have a shower","wash under water","принимать душ","мыться под водой","I usually have a shower.","usually + verb","I usually have a shower."],["go to work","travel to your job","идти на работу","добираться до работы","I go to work at eight.","go to work + at + time","She goes to work at nine."],["have lunch","eat in the middle of the day","обедать","есть в середине дня","I usually have lunch at one.","have lunch + at + time","We have lunch at twelve."],["go home","travel to your house","идти домой","добираться до дома","I go home at six.","go home + at + time","She goes home at five."],["have dinner","eat in the evening","ужинать","есть вечером","We always have dinner at seven.","have dinner + at + time","They have dinner at eight."],["watch TV","look at the television","смотреть телевизор","смотреть телевидение","I sometimes watch TV.","sometimes + verb","I sometimes watch TV."],["go to bed","go and sleep","ложиться спать","идти спать","I never go to bed late.","never + verb","I never go to bed early."],["morning","the first part of the day","утро","первая часть дня","I get up in the morning.","in the morning","I work in the morning."],["evening","the last part of the day","вечер","последняя часть дня","I watch TV in the evening.","in the evening","I read in the evening."],["always","every time","всегда","каждый раз","I always have breakfast.","always + verb","She always has tea."],["never","not at any time","никогда","ни в какое время","I never drink coffee.","never + verb","He never gets up late."]],"g":{"title":"Adverbs of frequency","rule":"<p>Say <b>how often</b> you do something.</p><table><tr><td>100%</td><td>I <b>always</b> have breakfast.</td></tr><tr><td>80%</td><td>I <b>usually</b> get up at seven.</td></tr><tr><td>40%</td><td>I <b>sometimes</b> watch TV.</td></tr><tr><td>0%</td><td>I <b>never</b> go to bed late.</td></tr></table>","ru":"Always (всегда), usually (обычно), sometimes (иногда), never (никогда) стоят перед глаголом: I always have breakfast.","ex":[{"t":"mc","q":"I ___ get up at seven. (80%)","o":["never","usually","sometimes"],"a":1},{"t":"mc","q":"She ___ drinks coffee. (0%)","o":["never","always","usually"],"a":0},{"t":"gap","q":"We ___ have dinner at seven. (100%)","a":["always"]}]},"talk":["Talk about your day: I always… I usually… I never…","Ask your partner: What time do you usually get up?"],"lessons":[{"id":"v1","type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary in context","from":0,"to":12},{"id":"g","type":"grammar","title":"Adverbs of frequency"},{"id":"s","type":"speaking","title":"Speaking: Good morning, goodnight"},{"id":"c","type":"check","title":"Unit check"}]}}}